            owl:unionOf ( <http://sw-portal.deri.org/ontologies/swportal#Book> <http://sw-portal.deri.org/ontologies/swportal#Proceedings> <http://sw-portal.deri.org/ontologies/swportal#Techreport> <http://sw-portal.deri.org/ontologies/swportal#Deliverable> <http://sw-portal.deri.org/ontologies/swportal#Volume> ) ] ;
